                    Operations. Secret. A note on the source text indicates that McNamara saw it.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d111-f2" n="2" xml:id="d111-f2-content">
                <p>The proposed agenda of the July 15 meeting is in the Johnson Library, National
                    Security File, Country File, Laos, Vol. XIII, Memos, 7/64.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d111-f3" n="3" xml:id="d111-f3-content">
                <p>
                    CIA is undertaking to see that US personnel are
                    briefed on how to extricate themselves and that the possibility helo evacuation
                    is examined. [Footnote in the source text.]</p>
            </note>
